
  archcloud — Arch Linux / CachyOS unattended cloud installer

  The installer runs automatically in a tmux session named "archcloud".
    attach:   tmux attach -t archcloud        abort:  archcloud-install abort
    manual:   archcloud-install [--dry-run]   config: /etc/archcloud/install.conf

  Overrides: kernel cmdline archcloud.<key>=<value>  or a volume labelled
  ARCHCLOUD / CIDATA holding install.conf, authorized_keys, network/*.network
  Booted with archcloud.autoinstall=no: nothing touches the disk.

